From 33d3450acda8ad193764e48a55f0096032999592 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:14:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1021/1022] SableOS: pure Photos keyboard model and album
 type-to-jump

The Sable Photos key model (MEDIA_GALLERY_UX "Input contract") for a
keyboard with Alt, Shift and Sym but no Ctrl or Fn key, such as the
Zinwa Q25:

* SableGalleryKeys.viewer: Left/J previous, Right/K next, Space
  play/pause for a video and next for a photo (Shift+Space previous),
  + and - zoom (Alt+O and Alt+I on the Q25; = and the keypad keys
  too), 0 fits again, I info, S share, F favorite, D or Del delete.
  Arrows and Space stay with a focused toolbar or bottom-bar button.
* SableGalleryKeys.grid: Space opens the focused thumbnail like Enter,
  D or Del delete and S share; never while picking for another app.
* SableGalleryKeys.zoomStep: one 1.5x step, kept within the viewer's
  scale bounds.
* SableTypeAhead: letters typed within a second build a prefix that
  moves focus to the first matching name; repeating one letter cycles;
  case and accents are ignored. It only moves focus.

Ctrl and Meta chords are never ours; only moving and zooming repeat.
Pure Java (sable/), so Android.bp also compiles Java sources. Host
tests live in the SableOS Q25 repository under
tests/java/stock-apps/Glimpse.
